{"unit_id":"x2802490130-prog__dsh-shield#card-zh","repo":"x2802490130-prog/dsh-shield","commit":"56db93deae6ea2b7bf3722907501f5e8c282b6e3","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-shield 是一个面向 DSH Web 客户端的删除操作回收站插件。它在 tools/execute 中间件中检查 shell 命令和 fs 删除调用：将目录移入回收站，并在特定链接路径场景调整命令；还会处理常见 glob 删除目标。用户可在设置页的「回收站」分区查看条目、恢复原位置、删除单项或清空回收站。插件也会按保留期限和容量清理旧条目，并支持可选的 Windows 系统回收站模式。回收站目录默认位于 DSH 主目录下，可通过 profile 配置调整；不需要额外 API Key 或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:252-324","lib/index.js:334-415","client/client.js:30-92"]}
{"unit_id":"x2802490130-prog__dsh-shield#card-en","repo":"x2802490130-prog/dsh-shield","commit":"56db93deae6ea2b7bf3722907501f5e8c282b6e3","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-shield adds a recovery bin for DSH deletions. Middleware checks shell and filesystem deletion calls and moves matching directories into the bin. The settings page lists, restores, or removes entries. Cleanup applies age and capacity limits; the storage path is configurable.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:252-324","lib/index.js:334-415","client/client.js:30-92"]}
